---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="FAQ"
  description="Straight answers about the SDA process, packages, and how high-academic swim recruiting actually works."
>

<!-- HERO -->
<header class="faq-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="faq-hero-content">
      <span class="eyebrow">Frequently Asked Questions</span>
      <h1>Recruiting is complicated <br><em> our answers are not.</em></h1>
      <p>Transparent answers about our process, our packages, and how high-academic recruiting really works</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="faq-section">
  <div class="wrap faq-layout">

    <div class="faq-intro">
      <h2>Questions before getting started?</h2>
      <p>Explore the most common questions families have about our process. If you still have questions, book a free consultation and speak directly with our team.</p>
      <a class="btn-gold" href="../contact">Talk to our team</a>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-list">

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" type="button" id="faq-q1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a1"><span>What is Signing Day Advisors?</span><span class="faq-symbol">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-a1" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-q1">Signing Day Advisors help student-athletes and their families understand where they stand in the recruiting process and build a strategy around their academic, athletic, and recruiting goals.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" type="button" id="faq-q2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a2"><span>What is the SDA Compass?</span><span class="faq-symbol">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-a2" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-q2">
          The SDA Compass is in-house built recruiting fit score. It looks at three categories and compares your athlete to each school on their list, so you know where they stand.
          <div class="a-chips">
            <span class="a-chip"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M8 3 L14 5.5 L8 8 L2 5.5 Z" fill="#C9A13B"/></svg>Academics</span>
            <span class="a-chip"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M2 7 q2 -2 4 0 q2 2 4 0 q2 -2 4 0" stroke="#C9A13B" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M2 11 q2 -2 4 0 q2 2 4 0 q2 -2 4 0" stroke="#C9A13B" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg>Athletics</span>
            <span class="a-chip"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M8 2 L9.5 6 L14 6.3 L10.5 9 L11.7 13 L8 10.7 L4.3 13 L5.5 9 L2 6.3 L6.5 6 Z" fill="#C9A13B"/></svg>Activities</span>
          </div>
          <a class="a-link" href="../academic-index#how-it-works">See how the Compass works <span class="arw">&rarr;</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" type="button" id="faq-q3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a3"><span>Who is SDA designed for?</span><span class="faq-symbol">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-a3" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-q3">SDA is built for student-athletes and families who want a structured, data-informed approach to navigating college recruiting. Our end goal is to find a school that balances strong academics with your athletic ambitions.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" type="button" id="faq-q4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a4"><span>What schools does SDA focus on?</span><span class="faq-symbol">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-a4" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-q4">
          We focus on academically strong programs, where grades matter just as much as times in the recruiting process.
          <div class="a-chips">
            <span class="a-chip">Ivy League</span>
            <span class="a-chip">NESCAC</span>
            <span class="a-chip">UAA</span>
            <span class="a-chip">High-Academic Division I</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" type="button" id="faq-q5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a5"><span>When should an athlete start the recruiting process?</span><span class="faq-symbol">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-a5" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-q5">Recruiting timelines vary by sport, school, and athlete. Starting early gives families more time to understand the landscape, develop the athlete's profile, and make informed decisions as opportunities arise. Book a consultation to learn more about our personalized timelines and key recruiting dates.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" type="button" id="faq-q6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a6"><span>What makes SDA different?</span><span class="faq-symbol">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-a6" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-q6">
          We underwent this exact process ourselves, so we give families an honest evaluation-- not a sales pitch.
          <ul class="a-points">
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 8.5 L6.5 12 L13 4" stroke="#C9A13B" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Founded by athletes who competed at these level</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 8.5 L6.5 12 L13 4" stroke="#C9A13B" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>A transparent evaluation of where you stand, no inflated odds</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 8.5 L6.5 12 L13 4" stroke="#C9A13B" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>We know both the academic and athletic sides of recruiting</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" type="button" id="faq-q7" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a7"><span>Does SDA guarantee admission or a roster spot?</span><span class="faq-symbol">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-a7" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-q7">No. SDA provides recruiting guidance and assessment but cannot guarantee admission, athletic offers, roster positions, scholarships, or specific recruiting outcomes</div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" type="button" id="faq-q8" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a8"><span>Can families continue working with SDA after purchasing a package?</span><span class="faq-symbol">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-a8" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-q8">Yes. Purchasing a package is the beginning of your work with SDA, not the end. As your athlete progresses through the recruiting process, SDA can continue to provide strategy, communication guidance, decision-making support, and adjustments based on new opportunities, goals, and changes in your athlete's recruiting journey</div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" type="button" id="faq-q9" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a9"><span>How do we get started?</span><span class="faq-symbol">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-a9" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-q9">Start by booking a free consultation. This gives your family an opportunity to discuss your athlete's goals, ask questions, and determine which SDA service is right for you</div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CLOSING -->
<section class="closing">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Still have questions?</h2>
    <p>Start with a free consultation and talk through your athlete's goals with the SDA team</p>
    <a class="btn-gold" href="../contact/">Book a free consultation</a>
  </div>
</section>

</Base>

<style is:global>
/* NAV */
nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(15,42,74,0.96);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(201,161,59,0.25)}
.nav-links .active{color:var(--gold-soft)}

/* HERO */
.faq-hero{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:100px 0 92px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.faq-hero::after{content:"?";position:absolute;right:7%;top:50%;transform:translateY(-52%);font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:330px;line-height:1;color:rgba(201,161,59,0.06);pointer-events:none}
.faq-hero-content{max-width:900px;position:relative;z-index:2}
.faq-hero .eyebrow{display:block;margin-bottom:20px}
.faq-hero h1{font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,64px);margin-bottom:22px}
.faq-hero h1 em{color:var(--gold-soft);font-style:italic}
.faq-hero p{max-width:600px;color:#C7D2DE;font-size:18px}

/* FAQ */
.faq-section{padding:88px 0 104px}
.faq-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.65fr 1.35fr;gap:72px;align-items:start}
.faq-intro{position:sticky;top:110px}
.faq-intro .eyebrow{display:block;margin-bottom:16px}
.faq-intro h2{color:var(--navy);font-size:34px;margin-bottom:18px}
.faq-intro p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;margin-bottom:26px}
.btn-gold{display:inline-block;background:var(--gold);color:var(--navy);padding:14px 26px;border-radius:2px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;transition:all .2s}
.btn-gold:hover{background:var(--gold-soft);transform:translateY(-1px)}
.faq-list{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.faq-item{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.faq-question{width:100%;background:none;border:none;padding:24px 4px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:24px;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;color:var(--navy);font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:500}
.faq-question:hover{color:var(--gold)}
.faq-symbol{flex:none;width:28px;height:28px;border:1px solid var(--gold);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--gold);font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-size:18px;transition:all .25s ease}
.faq-answer{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;transition:max-height .4s ease,opacity .3s ease,padding .3s ease;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;max-width:720px;padding:0 54px 0 4px}
.faq-item.open .faq-answer{max-height:560px;opacity:1;padding:0 54px 26px 4px}
.faq-item.open .faq-symbol{background:var(--gold);color:var(--navy);transform:rotate(45deg)}

/* answer graphics */
.a-chips{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px}
.a-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.3px;color:var(--navy);background:rgba(201,161,59,0.12);border:1px solid rgba(201,161,59,0.4);border-radius:2px;padding:5px 11px}
.a-chip svg{width:13px;height:13px;flex:none}
.a-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-top:16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy)}
.a-link .arw{color:var(--gold);transition:transform .2s}
.a-link:hover .arw{transform:translateX(3px)}
.a-points{list-style:none;margin:14px 0 0;padding:0}
.a-points li{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:9px}
.a-points li:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.a-points svg{flex:none;width:16px;height:16px;margin-top:3px}

/* CLOSING */
.closing{background:var(--cream-2);padding:82px 0;text-align:center}
.closing h2{color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,44px);margin-bottom:18px}
.closing p{color:var(--muted);max-width:520px;margin:0 auto 30px;font-size:16px}

/* FOOTER */
footer{background:var(--navy-deep);color:#8FA0B3;padding:56px 0 38px}

@media(max-width:900px){.faq-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:42px}.faq-intro{position:static}}
@media(max-width:760px){
  .faq-hero{padding:76px 0 70px}
  .faq-hero::after{display:none}
  .faq-section{padding:68px 0 78px}
  .faq-question{font-size:18px}
}
</style>

<script is:inline>
  document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach(function (q) {
    q.addEventListener('click', function () {
      var open = q.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');
      q.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');
    });
  });
</script>
